    "Today is Sunday, and the weather is nice. Xiaoming and I are classmates, and we are also good friends. We both like playing soccer.",
    "At eight o'clock in the morning, I waited for him outside the school. By nine o'clock, he still hadn't come. I called him, and he said he couldn't go play soccer because he was sick.",
